"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:0834-01-01:0":{"b": ["Abdullah b. Tâhir sofocó la rebelión de Muhammed b. Kāsım en Tâlekān.", "00591821"], "d": ["Abdullah b. Tâhir sofocó la rebelión de Muhammed b. Kāsım en Tâlekān.", "00591821"]},
